  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: python-engineio 4.12.2+rhlw.1",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released python-engineio 4.12.2+rhlw.1 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-48809 and CVE-2026-48802.\n\nCVE-2026-48809: python-engineio has possible denial of service due to maximum payload size sometimes not being enforced\n\nCVE-2026-48802: python-engineio has unbound thread allocation that can cause denial of service\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for python-engineio 4.12.2 from PyPI.",
